# EcoSuit MK.I — ABH reference core
**Rs ≈ 2600 attometers (2.60 fm) · ice particulates as paper feed · not a worn point mass**

1.3 am was a gamma firehose (465 TW) with almost no gravity at arm’s length.
2600 am is the other side of the same scaling: quieter Hawking, impossible to wear.
M ∝ Rs.  P_H ∝ 1/M².  g ∝ M.  Lifetime ∝ M³.

